School Management Software

1. Project Overview

Build a modern, professional, secure, web-based School Management Software.

The system will manage:

- Students
- Classes
- Student fees
- Teachers
- Teacher salaries
- Attendance
- Student/Teacher IDs
- Student records
- Financial reports
- Dashboard statistics
- Student mobile/web app
- Teacher attendance app
- Admin authentication

The system should have a modern UI, responsive design, smooth animations, clean navigation, proper validation, and a professional school-management look.

