7. Student Fee Management

Create a dedicated Fees section.

Admin can select a student and enter the amount paid.

The system must record:

- Student
- Class
- Fee month
- Fee year
- Amount
- Payment date
- Payment status
- Payment reference/receipt number if required

The system must automatically calculate:

- Monthly fee
- Yearly expected fee
- Total paid
- Total remaining
- Monthly income
- Yearly income

Example:

If monthly fee is Rs. 5,000:

Monthly Fee = Rs. 5,000
Yearly Fee = Rs. 5,000 × 12
            = Rs. 60,000

The yearly calculation must be automatic.

The system must prevent accidental duplicate payment entries for the same student and month unless the administrator explicitly allows multiple transactions.

