18. Security

Security is a major requirement.

Implement:

- Secure authentication
- Password hashing
- Session management
- CSRF protection
- SQL injection protection
- XSS protection
- File upload validation
- Access control
- Role-based permissions
- Secure logout
- Session expiration
- Login protection

Never store passwords as plain text.

Never expose sensitive student/teacher information through unauthorized URLs or APIs.

